{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...Feel like collecting evidence\nfor a divorce case?": "",
  "It'll be the usual deal. Stake out a love hotel,\nsnap some photos, tail the guy, dig through some trash. You in?": "",
  "Usual deal. Stake out a love hotel, snap some photos,\ntail the guy, dig through some trash. You in?": "",
  "I'm in. A job's a job.": "",
  "I give up.\nI'll send you the details later.": "",
  "I give up. I'll send you the details later.": "",
  "And next time don't bring a gift, you hear?\nDoesn't feel right taking 'em from guys too broke to pay for 'em.": "",
  "And next time, don't bring a gift, you hear?\nYou're too broke to pay for them.": "",
  "Anything you say.": "",
  "Yes. Mhm. ...Okay.": "",
  "Yes. Yes, he's here... Okay.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nThat was Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Yagami-san. That was Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Apparently he wants your help\ngathering evidence. For a murder.": "",
  "Apparently he wants your help gathering evidence.\nFor a murder.": "",
  "A murder?": "",
  "Since when are we working a murder case?": "",
  "Wait, what? Did I miss us\ntaking a murder case?": "",
  "This is the first I've heard of it too.": "",
  "No, this is the first\nI've heard of it too.": "",
  "Go give Shintani a hand, Yagami. This blows that divorce\nI was gonna send you on out of the water.": "",
  "Yagami... Guess you can forget the divorce case.\nGo give Shintani a hand.": "",
  "Been years since we had a murder case.": "",
  "Been three years since we had\na murder case.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei says he's waiting for you at Tender,\nthat bar on Taihei Boulevard.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei says he's waiting at the bar\non Taihei Boulevard. You know where it is?": "",
  "Tender? I'm there all the time.": "",
  "The bar on Taihei...? Tender?": "",
  "Just making sure.": "",
  "That's the one. \"Bar Tender.\"": "",
  "It's called Tender.\nGot my first job here 20 years back.": "",
  "Bar Tender. Twenty years ago, this is where\nI got my first job in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Masuda-san never changes.\nRunning a bar must keep you young.": "",
  "Masuda still looks the same as always.\nGuess running a bar keeps you young.": "",
  "Hey, Tak.\nShintani-sensei's in the back.": "",
  "Hey, Tak. Shintani-sensei's in the back.": "",
  "Great. We've got some business to talk.": "",
  "Surprised to see me?": "",
  "I'd be more surprised if I didn't.": "",
  "I'd be more surprised if\nyou were gone, Mari.": "",
  "Who's that, Tak?\nA detective buddy?": "",
  "Who's that, Tak? A detective buddy?": "",
  "Not exactly, Mari.\nThis one's a client.": "",
  "Not exactly. He's a client.": "",
  "Won't be your client for long if you\ndon't show up on time. You're late.": "",
  "If you're gonna be working for me,\nyou gotta be on time. You're late.": "",
  "Come on, you called me here totally\nout of the blue. Chill out, maybe.": "",
  "You called me here totally out of the blue.\nSenpai or not, you don't get to complain.": "",
  "Oh, and I'm getting a drink.": "",
  "And I'm paying?": "",
  "Let's call it a business expense.": "",
  "Tell Genda it's a business expense.": "",
  "Here's a familiar face.\nKyohei Hamura from the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "From the Matsugane Family of the Tojo Clan.\nKyohei Hamura. I assume you know him?": "",
  "I ran into him earlier, actually.\nTake it he's your client?": "",
  "I actually just ran into him.\nSo Captain Hamura... is your client?": "",
  "Yup, got hauled in earlier.\nThey're charging him with murder.": "",
  "Seriously?": "",
  "Seriously. So, the Matsugane patriarch\ncame to us for his defense.": "",
  "Seriously. So... the Matsugane patriarch\ncame to us for his defense.": "",
  "Genda-sensei's the go-to guy\nfor all his legal problems, y'know.": "",
  "Figures. Genda-sensei's the go-to guy\nfor all his legal problems, y'know.": "",
  "How'd you end up in\nthe driver's seat, then?": "",
  "How'd you end up\nin the driver's seat, then?": "",
  "...Genda-sensei gave him my card.": "",
  "...'Cause of Genda-sensei. Gave him my card,\nrecommended me...": "",
  "Gotta say, not looking forward\nto defending a yakuza.": "",
  "Gotta say, I'm really not looking forward to\ndefending a yakuza.": "",
  "Tough luck, I guess.": "",
  "Anyway, you're coming with me to the station.\nNeed to have a word with Hamura.": "",
  "I'm headed to the station for a word with Hamura.\nYou better come along.": "",
  "You've got way more yakuza\nexperience than me, after all.": "",
  "After all, you're the yakuza expert.": "",
  "Suppose I do.": "",
  "...Kind of.": "",
  "Lemme give you a rundown of the case first.": "",
  "Lemme give you a rundown\nof the case first.": "",
  "The victim was a yakuza.\nA Kansai guy, part of the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "The victim was a yakuza.\nA Kansai guy of the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "They found his body tossed\nin a dumpster just about a week ago.": "",
  "A week ago, they found his body\ntossed in a Kamurocho dumpster.": "",
  "Hold on, this is...": "",
  "The guy who got his eyes gouged out? Yup.": "",
  "Yeah. The guy who got his eyes gouged out...\nHe's our victim.": "",
  "Cops think Hamura's the one who did it.": "",
  "Cops think Hamura's the one\nwho did it.": "",
  "Helluva case, man.": "",
  "Some case.": "",
  "This is the third yakuza they've found like this.": "",
  "This is the third yakuza\nthey've found like this, too.": "",
  "Fortunately we're not dealing with\na triple homicide here, so the media isn't swarming.": "",
  "They're not treating it like a serial murder case, though.\nCouple complications.": "",
  "Hamura's got an alibi\nfor the first two incidents.": "",
  "This third murder's the only\none they're pinning on him.": "",
  "So, since he's only good for this third one,\nthat's what they're pinning on him.": "",
  "So they won't admit the cases are connected?": "",
  "They won't admit the cases\nare connected?": "",
  "Nope. Makes sense. Three bodies and not a single\nsuspect isn't exactly givin' the cops credibility.": "",
  "Nope. Three bodies and not a single suspect\nisn't exactly a boost to the ol' credibility.": "",
  "Guess they just wanna get this case closed\nand move on, even if they have to force it through.": "",
  "They just want to close the case,\neven if they have to force it through.": "",
  "And hey, the victim was yakuza.\nNobody really cares who hangs for it.": "",
  "The victim was a yakuza, anyway.\nNot like anyone cares who killed him.": "",
  "Why'd they come after Hamura of all people?": "",
  "Why'd they go after Hamura,\nof all people?": "",
  "Two reasons.": "",
  "First, the victim was a Kansai yakuza from a group that's been making\ninroads in Kamurocho. And picking fights with the Tojo Clan along the way.": "",
  "Odds are this was a Tojo guy wanting to send a message.\nAnd as you know, Hamura fits the bill.": "",
  "Odds are, this was a Tojo yakuza wanting to send a message.\nAnd, well, Hamura fits the bill.": "",
  "And the other reason?": "",
  "Hamura and the victim were seen having\na fight on the day of the crime.": "",
  "On the day of, a camera caught footage of\nHamura and the victim arguing.": "",
  "I'm guessing there's\nsecurity camera footage then...": "",
  "So they think the two of them\nhad a fight beforehand...": "",
  "You think Hamura really killed him?\nJust curious.": "",
  "You think Hamura really killed him?\nPersonally, I mean?": "",
  "I don't know, and I don't really care.": "",
  "Personally I don't know, don't care. ": "",
  "If he says he's innocent,\nI gotta prove he's innocent. That's my job.": "",
  "If he says he's innocent, I gotta prove he's innocent.\nThat's what a defense lawyer does.": "",
  "Has Hamura said anything to you?": "",
  "And Hamura? What's he said to you?": "",
  "Yeah, he told me he didn't do it.\nClaimed the cops were falsely accusing him.": "",
  "Told me he didn't do it.\nClaimed he's being falsely accused.": "",
  "So he insists he's innocent, huh.": "",
  "I think I know enough.\nWe should get to the station.": "",
  "You go on ahead. I've got some calls\nto make first. Just take a cab there.": "",
  "You go on ahead. I've got some calls to make first.\nA Kamurocho taxi's probably your best bet.": "",
  "Actually, I'm good.\nSee you at the station.": "",
  "Nothing. See you at the station.": "",
  "Shintani asked for you specifically, huh?\nWonder what the case is.": "",
  "Shintani asked for you specifically, huh...?\nMust be some case.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei is waiting\nfor you at Tender.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei is waiting for you at Tender.": "",
  "Leaving already, Tak?\nAnd only one drink in?": "",
  "Leaving already, Tak?\nNot staying for a drink?": "",
  "What can I say, I'm a busy man.": "",
  "Funny you should say that.\nAnother customer of mine has a job for you.": "",
  "Another customer of mine actually\nhad a job in mind for you...": "",
  "Tell you about it when\nyou're not so swamped, okay?": "",
  "Ah, it can wait until\nyou're not so busy.": "",
  "Hey, I'm not about to pass up a paying gig.": "",
  "I'm not about to pass up\na paying gig.": "",
  "Then come back when you\nand Shintani-sensei are done.": "",
  "Well, come back when\nyou're done with this one.": "",
  "Need something?": "",
  "Another customer of mine has a job for you, Tak.\nCome back when you and Shintani-sensei are done.": "",
  "Tak, a customer of mine has a job for you.\nCome back when you two are done.": "",
  "We just keep running into each other\ntonight, eh Tak? Why the long face?": "",
  "Yo. Beautiful night we're having, huh, Tak...?\nWhat, can't take a joke?": "",
  "I'm Shintani, from the Genda Law Office.\nThe Matsugane Family asked us to represent you.": "",
  "I, ah... My name's Shintani, from the Genda Law Office.\nThe Matsugane Family asked me to represent you.": "",
  "Then I'm glad you said yes, Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "Huh. Lucky for me you said yes,\nShintani-sensei.": "",
  "We're gonna get along real good.\nJust like my boss and Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Uhh, right.": "",
  "Ah... Right.": "",
  "Well, let's get started. I'll be taking point, while Yagami\nhere'll be doing the legwork to try and back up your claims.": "",
  "Well, let's get right into the facts of the case...\nI'll lead your defense, and Yagami here'll be doing the legwork.": "",
  "No better guy to do it.": "",
  "I'll do what I can.": "",
  "I'll do everything I can.": "",
  "Sooo, they brought you in under suspicion of murder.\nCan you tell me more about that? ": "",
  "Now, uh, they hauled you in under suspicion of murder...\nSo... can you tell me more about that? ": "",
  "Huh? What do you wanna know?": "",
  "Yeah. What do you wanna know?": "",
  "Whether or not you killed the guy.": "",
  "I'd like to know whether or not you did kill the guy.\nAnything to say?": "",
  "Does it really matter? Your job's getting me\noutta this mess regardless of the \"truth\".": "",
  "Does it really matter? You got one job here:\nsaving my ass regardless of the truth. Right?": "",
  "No. Because if I find out\nyou actually did it...": "",
  "Hm... I wouldn't say that.\nIf I find out you actually did it...": "",
  "You'll drop me?": "",
  "You'll drop the case?": "",
  "Better. I'll make sure the prosecution\nputs you away for life.": "",
  "No. I'll make sure the prosecution wins.\nThey'll put you away for life.": "",
  "This is bullshit!\nJust like you did that serial killer, huh!?": "",
  "That's bullshit! You bent over backwards\nto free a fucking serial killer!": "",
  "Uh, Yagami?": "",
  "All evidence at the time pointed\nto Shinpei Okubo being innocent.": "",
  "That was three years ago. All evidence at the time\npointed to Shinpei Okubo being innocent.": "",
  "That's why I chose to trust him.": "",
  "But then that Okubo guy...": "",
  "But Okubo still, ah...": "",
  "Well, he proved us all wrong.\nMurdered his girlfriend in cold blood. ": "",
  "...Murdered his girlfriend.\nEven burned her apartment down.": "",
  "C'mon, Tak. Let's be honest about what you\nwere really focused on at the time.": "",
  "Tak... All you wanted back then was a \"not guilty\"\nverdict. Didn't matter how you got it.": "",
  "You wanted that precious acquittal so bad, you didn't even\nstop to think you were setting a murderer loose. Right?": "",
  "You didn't even consider that he might actually\nbe a bad guy. A killer. Right? Let's be honest here.": "",
  "What happened to\n\"innocent until proven guilty\"?": "",
  "Try saying that to\nEmi Terasawa's parents.": "",
  "That's why you quit, right?\nYou couldn't face them.": "",
  "Then again, if you had the balls to face them...\nMaybe you'd still be a lawyer.": "",
  "Think we could maybe\nget back to the case?": "",
  "Uh... I'd really rather get back to this case.\nIs that okay?": "",
  "Sure, why not.": "",
  "...Yeah, sure.": "",
  "You good to go?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Dammit. Guess this is just\npart of the job.)</color>": "",
  "I'm fine. Keep going.": "",
  "My apologies.": "",
  "Now, let's start with the victim. Toshiro Kume,\n34 at his time of death. A member of the Kansai-based Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "Anyway... The victim was a Kyorei Clan yakuza.\nToshiro Kume, age 34.": "",
  "Around 6AM on the 4th of December, the police got a 110 call\nfrom someone who found his corpse in a pile of garbage.": "",
  "Around 6 AM on the 4th of December, the police got a 110 call.\nSomeone found his corpse in a pile of garbage.": "",
  "I hear you and this Kume had\nsome kinda argument before he died.": "",
  "What about other evidence? Anything definitively\nmark you as the killer?": "",
  "Did the police say what evidence points to you\nbeing the killer? Do they have anything substantial?": "",
  "Did the police give you any clues to work on?\nAny evidence that points to you being the killer?": "",
  "Nope, bastards are keeping their lips sealed.\nAin't that right, Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "Nope, bastards are keeping their lips sealed.\nRight, Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "Yes. At this point in the investigation,\nthe cops won't tell me what they've got against you.": "",
  "Yes... I'm afraid at this point in the investigation,\nthe cops won't tell me what they've got against you.": "",
  "Your words are the only thing\nwe'll have 'til the trial.": "",
  "Until the trial, Hamura-san's testimony\nmight be all we have.": "",
  "Tch. Is what it is.": "",
  "Hmph. That right?": "",
  "Anything else you wanna ask, Yagami?": "",
  "Well, Yagami... Since we have Hamura here,\nanything else you want to ask?": "",
  "Where did they record your fight with Kume?": "",
  "Where did you and Kume have your fight?": "",
  "Your fight with Kume...\nWhere was that?": "",
  "Out in front of a club.\nAmour, over on Suppon Street.": "",
  "On Suppon Street. A club called Amour.\nWe were out front.": "",
  "Me and a few Matsugane boys\nhad a little run in with a Kyorei guy.": "",
  "Me and a few Matsugane boys were out on the town.\nHad a little run in with this Kyorei guy.": "",
  "Turns out that was your boy, Kume.": "",
  "Pissed me off.\nThat was Kume, all right.": "",
  "And who started the fight?": "",
  "I assume you're the one who started it?": "",
  "Who do you think? I'm not gonna let some\nKansai punk strut around like he owns the place.": "",
  "'Course. I'm not gonna let some Kansai punk\nstrut around like he owns the place. Besides...": "",
  "I'd already thrown a few drinks\nback at that point, too.": "",
  "I might have been drinking a little.": "",
  "What time did all this go down?": "",
  "Just past 9.": "",
  "I wanna see that footage if possible.\nWon't be easy to get our hands on it, though.": "",
  "Like I already said, the prosecution won't show us their evidence.\nNot 'til they actually press charges.": "",
  "So what happened after you and Kume\nhad your standoff? Went your separate ways?": "",
  "So you and Kume fought, and then what?\nYou both went your separate ways?": "",
  "Nah. He tried to split, but I had my boys\ngrab him. Dragged him into Amour.": "",
  "Nah. He tried to split, but I had my boys grab him.\nDragged him into Amour.": "",
  "I thought it was just a little scuffle, though.\nYou're saying you abducted Kume on a crowded public street?": "",
  "But I thought it was just a little scuffle, right...?\nThen, you abducted him? On a crowded public street?": "",
  "Yup. Amour's one of the family businesses.": "",
  "Yup. Amour's one of the\nfamily businesses.": "",
  "So I went in, kicked the customers out...\nand kicked the crap outta Kume.": "",
  "But I'm tellin' you, I didn't kill the guy.\nJust tossed him out the back door when I was done with him.": "",
  "But I didn't kill the guy. Just tossed him\nout the back door when I was done with him.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Seriously?": "เอาจริงดิ?",
  "Need something?": "ต้องการอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Sure, why not.": "ได้ ทำไมจะไม่ได้",
  "My apologies.": "ขออภัยด้วย"
 }
}
